Once that third command finishes running, your GitHub Pages site updates instantly. You can then open Safari, go to your GitHub link (https://wordlergoof.github.io/wordle-2026/), and play today's game & tomorrow's game. To play tomorrow's game, you will need to advance the Mac system clock to the next day and then play. After playing tomorrow's game, remember to set the system clock to the current date and time.\
\
If you play today's game or tomorrow's game a second time and get message: "You have already played today's game", you can play the game again by opening a Safari window in Incognito mode: Command + Shift + N; to play the game in the regular Safari window (non-incognito mode), you will need to clear the browser cache entry for the url in question. To do this, when in Safari, go to Settings --> Privacy --> click on Manage Websites Data and type wordlergoof (github user-id) in the search box and hit Remove.\
